QSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"BrospeMqVM_tF9HH0RHuog","review_id":"mhDV6xRwOPXNjcClow6N8w","date":"2012-01-20T16:14:20","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9409667253494263,"text_excerpt":"This place definitely has an excellent hot sausage po-boy. That's what I generally focus on as a poboy. P;us, Gene's only serves meat based poboys -- no seafood poboys; less variety. And the dining area is comparable to that of a table seated next to an outhouse. Basically, it smells like dishwater...or worse. BUT you don't come for the seating area, you come for the food. And even though they don't serve anything but sausage-hamburger based poboys, they have one awesome hot sausage poboy. *Note, their roast beef is good enough. Recommendation? Definitely a place to grab and go."},{"business_id":"BrospeMqVM_tF9HH0RHuog","review_id":"MtmGNSMuGNsML_A3LhK9LQ","date":"2019-08-01T17:53:08","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9363181591033936,"text_excerpt":"Heard from a local this was the best place to get a po boy. Walked on the sketch part of town and I wasn't disappointed, they were out of shrimp which is what I went for but I ended up with a hot sausage and it was pretty good good spice-soft bread-tasty mayo and lettuce with cool ole kraft singles. This is America . This is classic po boys. I wish I could have tried the shrimp as I imagine it was even better."},{"business_id":"BrospeMqVM_tF9HH0RHuog","review_id":"l3zW9znVROFl47Yl2ulZHg","date":"2019-03-27T20:04:36","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9334648847579956,"text_excerpt":"This place is definitely one of the most interesting places I have been. We were told by our Uber driver that this is the best place for a Po Boy, and after being disappointed two evenings before we had to give it a try. It is a literal whole in the wall, with two tables on the inside. There was a homeless person dining with us as we sat at the only available second table (no biggie). The shrimp Po Boy had a ton of perfectly fried shrimp with great bread and sauce. The sausage hamburger Po Boy was a close second favorite of my group too! This place has great food, but not much atmosphere so go and check it out but don't plan to stay long at all!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"BrospeMqVM_tF9HH0RHuog","photo_id":"DLhspYdo81KMmKw4Pc7KRw","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/DLhspYdo81KMmKw4Pc7KRw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9167600274085999},{"business_id":"BrospeMqVM_tF9HH0RHuog","photo_id":"InhuKjHMBaLDpg5susVCfw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/InhuKjHMBaLDpg5susVCfw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8360933065414429},{"business_id":"BrospeMqVM_tF9HH0RHuog","photo_id":"9jiR3e9Uqs0lFCksJZSHdQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/9jiR3e9Uqs0lFCksJZSHdQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.794588029384613},{"business_id":"BrospeMqVM_tF9HH0RHuog","photo_id":"zSKDUSvmuGSrrLD6_ee9uA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/zSKDUSvmuGSrrLD6_ee9uA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7758383750915527}]},"notebook_case":null}
